                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <a href="#"><img src="assets/images/product-shower-filter/result-2.webp" alt="Dermal Mist (Duo - 100ml + 15ml)" /></a>
                            <a href="#">Dermal Mist (Duo - 100ml + 15ml)</a>
