                            <ul class=\"c-benefit-grid c-benefit-grid--sm\">
                                <li class=\"c-benefit-grid__item\">
                                    <span class=\"c-benefit-grid__icon\"><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-drop-check\"></i></span>
                                    <div class=\"c-benefit-grid__content\">
                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Deep Hydration</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Helps replenish moisture for skin that feels dry, tight, or dehydrated.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class=\"c-benefit-grid__item\">
                                    <span class=\"c-benefit-grid__icon\"><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-waves-2\"></i></span>
                                    <div class=\"c-benefit-grid__content\">
                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Visibly calms redness</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Helps reduce the appearance of visible redness and leaves skin feeling comfortable.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class=\"c-benefit-grid__item\">
                                    <span class=\"c-benefit-grid__icon\"><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-droplet\"></i></span>
                                    <div class=\"c-benefit-grid__content\">
                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Soft, Comfortable Skin</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Leaves skin feeling smooth, refreshed, and hydrated.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class=\"c-benefit-grid__item\">
                                    <span class=\"c-benefit-grid__icon\"><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-strengthens\"></i></span>
                                    <div class=\"c-benefit-grid__content\">
                                        <strong class=\"c-benefit-grid__title\">Strengthens skin\'s barrier</strong>
                                        <p class=\"c-benefit-grid__text\">Helps support the skin’s natural moisture barrier with Beta-Glucan, Centella Asiatica, and Ectoin.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class=\"e-declaimer\">
                                <i class=\"e-icon e-icon-clock-2\"></i>
                                A simple 15-20 minute reset for hydration, travel, after Micro-Infusion, or whenever skin needs extra comfort.
                            </p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Polyglutamic Acid</h3>
                                    A next-generation humectant derived from fermentation that helps lock in moisture, reduce moisture loss, and leave skin visibly plumper and more hydrated.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Beta-Glucan</h3>
                                    Helps calm the appearance of visible redness and support the skin’s natural moisture barrier, making it well suited to dry, sensitive, and stressed skin.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Centella Asiatica (Cica)</h3>
                                    A well-known soothing botanical that helps calm stressed-looking skin, reduce the appearance of visible redness, and support the skin barrier.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Ectoin</h3>
                                    An extremolyte that helps protect skin from environmental stressors and support the skin barrier.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Sodium Hyaluronate</h3>
                                    A form of hyaluronic acid that helps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin feeling softer and more hydrated.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Allantoin</h3>
                                    Helps soothe dry, stressed skin, reduce visible flaking, and leave skin feeling soft and comfortable.
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        "
                    },
                    {
                        "summary": "How It Works",
                        "text": "
                            <p>Apply immediately after Micro-Infusion treatment.</p>
                            <ol>
                                <li>Remove the mask from its pouch and carefully unfold.</li>
                                <li>Apply directly to the face after Micro-Infusion, without cleansing or drying the skin first.</li>
                                <li>Leave on for 15-20 minutes.</li>
                                <li>Remove the mask and gently massage any remaining serum into the skin.</li>
                                <li>Do not rinse. Leave the remaining serum on overnight.</li>
                                <li>Follow with your regular cleanser the next morning.</li>
                            </ol>
                            <p><i class=\"e-icon e-icon-snow\"></i>Pro tip: Store the sealed pouch in the refrigerator before use for an enhanced cooling effect.</p>
                        "
                    },
                    {
                        "summary": "Full ingredient list",
                        "text": "
                            <p>Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Erythritol, Panthenol, Propanediol, Polyglutamic Acid, Beta-Glucan, Centella Asiatica Extract, Ectoin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Magnesium Gluconate, Methyl Diisopropyl Propionamide, Allantoin, Pentylene Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Xanthan Gum, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate.</p>
                            <p><strong>Product Specifications</strong></p>
                            <table>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Material</td>
                                    <td><strong>TENCEL (Lyocell Fiber) biodegradable</strong></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Fill Volume</td>
                                    <td><strong>30 mL per single mask pouch</strong></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Application Time</td>
                                    <td><strong>15 to 20 minutes max</strong></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Free From</td>
                                    <td><strong>Fragrance, Alcohols, Parabens, PEG</strong></td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        "
                    }
                ]'
            }}
